Technics SX-KN6000 / SX-KN6500 floppy disks.

User-data and sound-library disks the instrument installs from its floppy drive: the
"Initial Data" factory-default set (idd6000) plus style, registration, picture and
sound libraries.  Each is available as a self-extracting PC archive that writes its
payload onto a blank FAT12 HD diskette; who prepared or distributed the library disks
is unclear (not necessarily official releases), and no original diskette has been
dumped, so these images are faithful reconstructions built from the archives' own
files, which a dump of an original could supersede.
-->
